    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάλ-ωμα</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱλ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό,
			ἀνήλωμα</span> freq. in Pap. and Inscrr. as <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			22.1228.12
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			12(5).1061.17
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, Wilcken <i><span class="en">
			<u>Chrest.</u>
			30 i1
		</span></i> (ca. <i><span class="en">
			200
		</span></i> B.C.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>expense, cost,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				476
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῆμμα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				32.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				920c
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>expenses,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.106
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐσίαν, ἧς αἱ πρόσοδοι λύουσι
					τἀναλώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					32.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν ἰδίων ἀναλωμάτων
				καθοπλίζειν</span> at their own private <i>costs,</i>
			Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.116
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.3073
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαιόν γε τἀνάλωμα τῆς γλώσσης τόδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					547
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>exhalation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.384a
			</span></i> codd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλ-ωμάτιον</span></b> , τό, 
				Dim. of
			 foreg., <i>slight loss,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				67.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>trifling expenditure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				131.3
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>.</div>
